> Falcons eye keeps freezing on me.  I'm told that it is known to be
> real buggy.  Anyway, is there a way to simply transfer all my falcon's
> eye stuff into my nethack save directory?

Make sure you've got the same version of the real thing and unpack the
game to a new directory. Then copy the following files to this new
directory, over the recently unpacked ones:

record, logfile, bones*.*, *.sav*

Then, edit the defaults.nh file, while looking at your old defaults.nh.
You might copy your existing one over the new one, but you might miss out
on some options that exist for the real thing only, not for falcon's eye.

